flowchart LR
accTitle: CoALA responsibilities mapped to the Java application
accDescr: Information storage maps to four memory responsibilities and retrieval. Action space includes internal actions, perception, and grounding. Planning proposes and evaluates candidates, while the full runtime coordinates the cycle.

    I[Information storage] --> M[Memory services]
    M --> WM[Working memory]
    M --> EM[Episodic memory]
    M --> SM[Semantic memory]
    M --> PM[Procedural memory]
    A[Action space] --> IA[Internal handlers]
    A --> PA[Perception handlers]
    A --> GA[Grounding handlers]
    D[Decision procedure] --> P[Planning strategies]
    P --> E[Candidate evaluation]
    E --> R[Runtime coordination]
    M --> R
    IA --> R
    PA --> R
    GA --> R
